<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DECLARE AT 213-7 AT START OF FINAL DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DECLARE AT 213-7 AT START OF FINAL DAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia declared their first innings at their overnight score of 213 for seven, a lead of 136 over England, at the start of the final day of the second Ashes test at Lord's.</p>
</text>
